# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002213> (positively regulates)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002213> "p positively regulates q iff p regulates q, and p increases the rate or magnitude of execution of q.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002213> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/valid_for_go_annotation_extension>)
